# Local build products and workspace metadata.
#
# Every binary pattern is anchored to the repository root on purpose: an
# unanchored `agent` also matches the directory `internal/agent`, which silently
# kept the whole probe agent out of version control. Build products live at the
# root (or under /dist, /data), never inside a package directory.
/agent
/agent.exe
/.zcode/
/.mem/
/.agents/

